1
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:42,760
Finding someone based on a mole

2
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,319
is like looking for a needle in a haystack.

3
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,079
It's been over two weeks,

4
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:49,200
and we don't have a single clue.

5
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:51,159
Just stop complaining, will you?

6
00:01:51,159 --> 00:01:52,879
That's just how these investigations go.

7
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,239
It's like buying a lottery ticket.

8
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:56,040
Not only do you need perseverance,

9
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,879
you also need a bit of luck, right?

10
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:00,760
What we're missing is that bit of luck.

11
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:04,280
How many buy lottery tickets in China?

12
00:02:04,719 --> 00:02:05,760
How many of them actually win?

13
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,159
Then you're doing it wrong.

14
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:10,120
If it's not working, get more manpower.

15
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,759
Expand the search area.

16
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,080
Let me tell you, with more people,

17
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:14,919
won't your chances of winning go up?

18
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,000
Right?

19
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,479
Then go tell that to Chief Guo.

20
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:44,919
Today's training killed me.

21
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,080
It really was exhausting.

22
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:51,800
Commissar Tan.

23
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:53,159
Yeah.

24
00:03:02,759 --> 00:03:03,319
Commissar Tan.

25
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:03,879
Hurry up and shower.

26
00:03:03,919 --> 00:03:04,800
The hot water will run out soon.

27
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,319
Alright, alright.

28
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:07,520
We're heading out.

29
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:08,520
Goodbye.

30
00:03:36,879 --> 00:03:37,199
Attention!

31
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,719
Right dress!

32
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,280
Eyes front!

33
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:48,479
Where's Lü Xiao?

34
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:53,680
He's on leave.

35
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,199
Why is he on leave?

36
00:04:09,319 --> 00:04:10,080
His mom's sick.

37
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:12,000
Sick again?

38
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:15,319
When was the last time his mom was sick?

39
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,199
Last month.

40
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,399
She had a 40-degree fever.

41
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:22,319
She was hospitalized.

42
00:04:22,319 --> 00:04:23,000
And the time before that?

43
00:04:23,839 --> 00:04:25,639
The time before that was also last month.

44
00:04:26,439 --> 00:04:28,279
Acute appendicitis. Also hospitalized.

45
00:04:29,279 --> 00:04:30,360
What's she sick with this time?

46
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:49,360
What illness is it this time?

47
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:57,560
This time... This time, it doesn't seem too serious.

48
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,000
His mom is alone in Lvteng.

49
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,319
He's from a single-parent family.

50
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,839
And he's an only child.

51
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:04,319
Right.

52
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,160
You approved his leave?

53
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,160
Sort of.

54
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,399
Maybe it's true this time.

55
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,800
We should be compassionate leaders.

56
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:13,399
Don't you think?

57
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:17,800
Compassionate?

58
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:19,720
Then do you know

59
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,519
how many times he's taken leave this quarter?

60
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,920
I... I don't have those details yet.

61
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,000
Whoever approved it takes responsibility.

62
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:28,079
Tonight's mission: patrol and inspection.

63
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:28,920
We head out in five minutes.

64
00:06:04,639 --> 00:06:05,720
This Mingliu...

65
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:07,879
Have you been there?

66
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,480
No.

67
00:06:10,519 --> 00:06:12,399
It's the most popular club around here.

68
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,720
It gets a lot of foot traffic.

69
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,399
I've heard of it.

70
00:06:19,319 --> 00:06:20,959
Alright, thanks for cooperating. You can go.

71
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,759
Hello, Comrade.

72
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:24,920
Routine inspection.

73
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,160
Please show your ID.

74
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:31,879
Alright, thanks for your cooperation.

75
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,120
Hello. Routine inspection.

76
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:35,519
Please show your ID.

77
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:36,000
Alright, thanks for your cooperation.

78
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,480
Please hold out your right hand.

79
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:39,759
Please hold out your right hand.

80
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:40,279
Thanks for your cooperation.

81
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:43,000
Hello. Please show your ID.

82
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:43,639
Okay, okay.

83
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,839
Hello. Please show your right hand.

84
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:57,800
Special Police comrades, you're on duty.

85
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,040
Thanks for your hard work.

86
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:02,600
We're working.

87
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:02,920
Please have some water.

88
00:07:04,759 --> 00:07:05,839
Please show your ID.

89
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:15,920
Lu Haifeng.

90
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:16,759
That's me.

91
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,360
Is this club yours?

92
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,040
You run quite a big business.

93
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,560
Just making a living.

94
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:25,680
How should I address you?

95
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:27,759
My surname is Liao.

96
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:32,519
This is the Commander of our Special Police Unit,

97
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,319
Liao Bufan.

98
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:36,959
I'm Political Commissar Tan Yan of the Special Police Unit.

99
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,240
Hello, Commissar Tan.

100
00:07:38,879 --> 00:07:39,720
Hello, Mr. Lu.

101
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,720
Usually, the ones who come here are

102
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,720
comrades from the local police station.

103
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:47,839
They haven't dealt with the Special Police.

104
00:07:48,639 --> 00:07:49,279
Mr. Lu,

105
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,000
Mingliu Club

106
00:07:51,199 --> 00:07:52,399
gets a lot of foot traffic.

107
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:54,800
We need to pay special attention to it.

108
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:57,240
Hope you don't mind us affecting your business.

109
00:07:57,319 --> 00:07:58,319
Thanks for your support.

110
00:07:58,399 --> 00:07:59,519
Of course I don't mind.

111
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,959
With the Special Police here on official duty,

112
00:08:02,319 --> 00:08:03,399
we feel much safer.

113
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,600
But this is an entertainment venue, after all.

114
00:08:07,199 --> 00:08:07,959
We open our doors to all guests.

115
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:10,600
I guarantee the club is fully compliant.

116
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,120
But I can't guarantee

117
00:08:12,199 --> 00:08:14,360
that all the guests who come in are clean.

118
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:15,120
Am I right?

119
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:17,519
That's why we're doing inspections. Routine inspections.

120
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:18,879
We're just doing our jobs too.

121
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,560
Let's cooperate with each other.

122
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,360
I will cooperate fully.

123
00:08:23,519 --> 00:08:24,319
Officers,

124
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:26,120
would you like to go inside and rest? Have some tea?

125
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:28,160
No need. We're in the middle of a mission.

126
00:08:28,319 --> 00:08:29,040
You can get back to work.

127
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:31,560
Alright, then I won't delay your official duties.

128
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:34,480
I'll have Little Zhang stay here to assist you.

129
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,559
Come inside and sit when you have time.

130
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,799
Thanks for understanding.

131
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,080
Cooperate well.

132
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:40,559
Okay.

133
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:45,639
Officers, have some water.

134
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:46,759
We're on duty.

135
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,759
Manager Zhang,

136
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:56,159
is your Mr. Lu in his fifties?

137
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,000
His hair is all white.

138
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,080
Thanks for your cooperation.

139
00:08:59,360 --> 00:08:59,720
Thanks for cooperating.

140
00:09:03,519 --> 00:09:04,759
We've been checking for so long,

141
00:09:05,039 --> 00:09:06,360
and haven't seen a single suspicious person.

142
00:09:14,639 --> 00:09:15,399
I saw one.

143
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:16,399
Where?

144
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:22,039
Coming to the bar street but not going to a bar,

145
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,399
just strolling outside.

146
00:09:23,759 --> 00:09:24,600
You're so boring.

147
00:09:25,039 --> 00:09:25,759
Exactly.

148
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,879
Didn't I tell you?

149
00:09:26,919 --> 00:09:28,159
I brought you out to see something new.

150
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:31,639
Brother Lü Xiao,

151
00:09:32,159 --> 00:09:33,240
then next time,

152
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,720
could you also invite Sister Bai Jiani

153
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,799
out to hang out with us?

154
00:09:36,879 --> 00:09:37,360
Her?

155
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:39,240
She would never come to a place like this.

156
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:41,200
Then where does she usually hang out?

157
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:50,879
You're really living it up, huh.

158
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,600
Mentor, why are you guys...

159
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,440
Why are we here?

160
00:09:54,519 --> 00:09:55,720
I want to ask why you're here.

161
00:09:56,399 --> 00:09:57,399
We're here working.

162
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:58,480
And you're here fooling around.

163
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:00,200
No, Mentor, let me explain.

164
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,039
Explain what?

165
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,919
Go back and explain it to Chief Liao.

166
00:10:03,519 --> 00:10:04,799
You're really something, Lü Xiao.

167
00:10:05,759 --> 00:10:07,960
Taking leave to go clubbing with two girls.

168
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:10,159
No, it's not like that.

169
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:11,480
Introduce us.

170
00:10:11,519 --> 00:10:12,720
Which one is your girlfriend?

171
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,519
Friends. Just regular friends.

172
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,000
Do you two know him well?

173
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,039
Not really. Very well.

174
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,639
I even know your name is Bai Jiani.

175
00:10:18,799 --> 00:10:19,320
Mentor.

176
00:10:19,919 --> 00:10:20,960
You know the kind of person I am.

177
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,120
I would never do something like this.

178
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:22,879
Don't call me Mentor.

179
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,120
I can't handle a mentee like you.

180
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,919
Brother Lü Xiao!

181
00:10:29,759 --> 00:10:30,679
Jiani, this is a misunderstanding.

182
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,519
I didn't misunderstand.

183
00:10:32,159 --> 00:10:33,519
How old are you two? Got your IDs?

184
00:10:33,519 --> 00:10:34,200
This is a misunderstanding.

185
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,759
Why won't you let me explain, Mentor?

186
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:36,759
You'll have time to explain.

187
00:10:42,679 --> 00:10:43,279
Lü Xiao.

188
00:10:44,159 --> 00:10:44,679
Lü Xiao.

189
00:10:45,879 --> 00:10:47,039
Just turned 18.

190
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:51,759
You're really playing with fire.

191
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,480
What are you thinking? They're just friends.

192
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:58,440
It's over. No friend can save you this time.

193
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,600
Xiao Lü.

194
00:11:15,279 --> 00:11:17,600
You faked your ideological report.

195
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,159
I'll let that slide.

196
00:11:20,519 --> 00:11:21,720
Taking too much time off

197
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,759
is already a breach of discipline.

198
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,039
And making up an excuse on top of it.

199
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:26,159
What am I going to do with you?

200
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:35,360
Chief Liao, what do you think?

201
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,039
I have no objections.

202
00:11:37,039 --> 00:11:38,399
Whoever approved the leave is responsible.

203
00:11:42,639 --> 00:11:44,960
Then a 2,000-word self-criticism letter.

204
00:11:45,879 --> 00:11:47,960
And I'll apply to our superiors

205
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,679
for a department-wide public reprimand.

206
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:53,519
Commissar Tan, do you know why I took leave?

207
00:11:59,919 --> 00:12:01,720
Those two girls are students we met

208
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,360
on Police Open Day.

209
00:12:03,639 --> 00:12:04,799
They helped us film that video.

210
00:12:05,799 --> 00:12:07,480
It's our last video with Commissar Lu.

211
00:12:09,639 --> 00:12:11,360
Three, two, one, cheese.

212
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:13,519
Yes, I was there at the time too.

213
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:15,679
All right, you two.

214
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:17,000
We still have work to do, a mission to complete.

215
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,279
That's it for today.

216
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,039
Hurry up.

217
00:12:19,039 --> 00:12:19,399
Okay.

218
00:12:20,799 --> 00:12:21,519
Hurry, hurry.

219
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,000
Commissar Tan.

220
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:26,279
Now I understand why this kid did it.

221
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:29,679
This video really is very precious.

222
00:12:33,679 --> 00:12:34,840
No matter the reason,

223
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:40,559
Lü Xiao has repeatedly ignored discipline.

224
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,759
He must learn his lesson.

225
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,480
Valuable experience

226
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:48,120
always comes from hard lessons.

227
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,679
You have no idea what this video

228
00:12:54,679 --> 00:12:55,960
means to our Special Police Unit.

229
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:57,919
Just punish me.

230
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,559
Stop talking.

231
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,360
Commissar Tan

232
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,720
is a compassionate leader.

233
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,559
He surely understands your reasons.

234
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:10,600
Apologize now.

235
00:13:11,879 --> 00:13:12,360
Admit your mistake.

236
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,320
What did I do wrong?

237
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,639
What did I do wrong?

238
00:13:16,639 --> 00:13:17,799
Who are you yelling at?

239
00:13:19,679 --> 00:13:20,000
Captain Liu,

240
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,519
it has nothing to do with compassion.

241
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,159
This is a matter of principle.

242
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:30,679
Commissar Lu wouldn't turn a blind eye

243
00:13:30,679 --> 00:13:32,039
to your repeated mistakes

244
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,360
either.

245
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,759
What do you think, Xiao Lü?

246
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:56,919
Comrade Xiao Lü

247
00:14:28,519 --> 00:14:31,200
Still busy, Chief Liao?

248
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,080
Why haven't you gone home yet?

249
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,919
I brought you a box of tea. White tea.

250
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:41,320
It helps with inflammation.

251
00:14:42,399 --> 00:14:43,200
It tastes great.

252
00:14:46,039 --> 00:14:46,799
You need something?

253
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,039
Just a little something.

254
00:14:51,559 --> 00:14:52,159
What is it?

255
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,320
Come on in.

256
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,240
Chief Liao.

257
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,440
I told you, I'm not interfering.

258
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:10,279
Commissar Tan has full authority.

259
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:18,600
Chief Liao.

260
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,559
I'll accept any punishment you give me.

261
00:15:21,519 --> 00:15:23,159
If he pulls this department-wide public reprimand stunt,

262
00:15:24,039 --> 00:15:25,279
I'll be a complete laughingstock!

263
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,440
At a time like this,

264
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:32,279
you're still worried about your pride?

265
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,320
Kid...

266
00:15:33,519 --> 00:15:35,360
What a department-wide public reprimand means...

267
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:36,240
Do you even know?

268
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,120
From now on,

269
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:39,840
you can kiss any awards or commendations goodbye.

270
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,279
With an attitude like yours,

271
00:15:41,279 --> 00:15:42,399
you still want to join Criminal Investigation?

272
00:15:43,159 --> 00:15:43,960
Who'd even want you?

273
00:15:47,679 --> 00:15:48,679
And you talk about pride!

274
00:15:59,120 --> 00:15:59,919
Chief Liao,

275
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,159
Out of respect for me,

276
00:16:03,039 --> 00:16:03,759
Commissar Tan

277
00:16:04,559 --> 00:16:05,320
might not necessarily oblige.

278
00:16:06,399 --> 00:16:07,480
But your opinion,

279
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:10,159
I think he'll still have to consider it.

280
00:16:11,399 --> 00:16:13,759
How about you put in a good word?

281
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:15,600
Old Liu,

282
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:18,320
I really can't bring this up.

283
00:16:21,039 --> 00:16:21,559
Lü Xiao,

284
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:25,679
the temper you lost the day Wang Yunsheng left...

285
00:16:27,039 --> 00:16:28,120
was pretty extreme.

286
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,120
Want to transfer to CID?

287
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,120
Chief... Chief Liao, listen to me.

288
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:34,960
Push a bit harder,

289
00:16:36,399 --> 00:16:37,240
you never know.

290
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:38,320
Chief... Chief Liao, I didn't...

291
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:38,799
Enough.

292
00:16:39,679 --> 00:16:40,200
Go back

293
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:42,399
and wait for the decision.

294
00:16:59,159 --> 00:17:01,120
Thanks for the tea, Brother Lang.

295
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:02,639
Don't mention it.

296
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,559
(Ideological report)

297
00:17:54,359 --> 00:17:55,359
Take my advice.

298
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,559
Find a chance today

299
00:17:57,799 --> 00:17:59,960
to swallow your pride and apologize to Commissar Tan.

300
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:04,279
Remember, you must be sincere.

301
00:18:05,599 --> 00:18:07,279
Whether your punishment gets reduced now

302
00:18:07,839 --> 00:18:09,359
is entirely up to you.

303
00:18:11,319 --> 00:18:12,160
I can't swallow my pride.

304
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,000
Even if I apologize,

305
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,079
he'll punish me anyway.

306
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:19,200
I might as well not.

307
00:18:19,599 --> 00:18:21,200
This isn't about whether you admit it.

308
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:23,000
A mistake is a mistake.

309
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,079
You have to take the punishment.

310
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:26,000
Come on, Bai Jiani.

311
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:26,880
Whose side are you on?

312
00:18:27,079 --> 00:18:28,279
I'm on the side of reason.

313
00:18:28,319 --> 00:18:29,279
Are you saying I'm being unreasonable?

314
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:31,000
Keep your voice down.

315
00:18:31,359 --> 00:18:31,960
If you needed the video,

316
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,319
why didn't you just ask her to send it?

317
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,440
Why did you have to meet up?

318
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,160
I asked, but she wouldn't.

319
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,359
She insisted on meeting first.

320
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:39,519
I added that girl on WeChat, you know.

321
00:18:39,759 --> 00:18:40,960
And I had a proper chat with her.

322
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,799
She's not an unreasonable person.

323
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:44,119
If you just talked to her nicely,

324
00:18:44,119 --> 00:18:45,160
I doubt she'd refuse you.

325
00:18:45,559 --> 00:18:46,960
She didn't act like that with me.

326
00:18:47,119 --> 00:18:47,319
Look,

327
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:49,279
couldn't you have done this on your day off?

328
00:18:49,559 --> 00:18:50,279
You just had to ask for leave,

329
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,279
and lie about it.

330
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:53,640
I was in a rush, alright?

331
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,319
Lü Xiao,

332
00:18:54,839 --> 00:18:56,559
this isn't just about you making a mistake anymore.

333
00:18:57,319 --> 00:18:58,880
It's that you refuse to admit it.

334
00:18:59,279 --> 00:18:59,640
And you're still here

335
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,279
coming up with all sorts of excuses.

336
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:02,759
What excuses did I make?

337
00:19:03,039 --> 00:19:03,880
Why would I even bother?

338
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:04,839
Worst comes to worst...

339
00:19:04,839 --> 00:19:06,000
Whether you quit is your own business.

340
00:19:06,119 --> 00:19:06,839
You're not threatening anyone else.

341
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:15,079
Come back!

342
00:19:21,559 --> 00:19:22,079
Stubborn mule.

343
00:19:24,039 --> 00:19:24,519
Captain Liu.

344
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:27,039
According to the Special Police Unit regulations,

345
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:29,000
shouldn't wasting food be punished too?

346
00:19:31,279 --> 00:19:31,759
It should be.

347
00:20:04,319 --> 00:20:04,839
Commissar Tan

348
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:09,440
Commissar Tan

349
00:20:09,519 --> 00:20:10,759
Come, sit here. Sit here.

350
00:20:10,759 --> 00:20:11,279
No, no, no.

351
00:20:12,039 --> 00:20:12,599
There are seats over there.

352
00:20:13,039 --> 00:20:13,559
Eat up.

353
00:20:14,279 --> 00:20:14,680
Commissar Tan.

354
00:20:14,839 --> 00:20:16,079
Sit down. Eat up.

355
00:20:19,519 --> 00:20:20,119
Is this...

356
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:22,240
All you're eating? And you're already finished?

357
00:20:22,519 --> 00:20:23,480
Almost done. I'm almost finished.

358
00:20:24,079 --> 00:20:24,720
You should eat more.

359
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:25,119
Okay.

360
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,240
The training load is huge.

361
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:30,319
Uh, Commissar, we're done eating.

362
00:20:30,319 --> 00:20:30,599
Alright.

363
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:31,119
Enjoy your meal.

364
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:52,680
Chief Liao

365
00:20:53,359 --> 00:20:53,799
Have you eaten?

366
00:20:53,799 --> 00:20:54,279
I have.

367
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:55,039
I have.

368
00:21:00,599 --> 00:21:01,920
Chief Liao's ideological report.

369
00:21:03,079 --> 00:21:04,599
I need to study it thoroughly.

370
00:21:12,559 --> 00:21:13,000
It's good.

371
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:15,599
Very thorough.

372
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:19,680
Especially this part on self-criticism.

373
00:21:21,720 --> 00:21:22,319
Spot on.

374
00:21:25,799 --> 00:21:27,200
The fault lies with me,

375
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:30,000
not with anyone else.

376
00:21:31,759 --> 00:21:33,680
High awareness and great perspective.

377
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:36,880
My team member made a mistake.

378
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:39,000
Of course I should reflect on it.

379
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:41,279
Our team member.

380
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,519
About Lü Xiao taking leave...

381
00:21:45,079 --> 00:21:46,039
I need to reflect on it.

382
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,079
I approved the leave, after all.

383
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,599
Since he's our team member,

384
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:53,400
let's just have him write a self-criticism letter.

385
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:57,680
Isn't a department-wide public reprimand a bit much?

386
00:22:00,759 --> 00:22:01,279
How about this?

387
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:04,559
Have Lü Xiao write a personal ideological breakthrough report.

388
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:06,680
It sounds a bit better.

389
00:22:08,359 --> 00:22:09,000
It doesn't need to sound good.

390
00:22:09,559 --> 00:22:10,200
He will write a self-criticism letter.

391
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:12,160
A serious and profound one.

392
00:22:13,319 --> 00:22:14,039
In that case,

393
00:22:14,079 --> 00:22:15,720
can we skip the department-wide public reprimand?

394
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:26,119
When leading a team,

395
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:28,079
we need their respect and obedience.

396
00:22:29,559 --> 00:22:30,319
We must nip problems in the bud.

397
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:33,960
Sometimes,

398
00:22:34,680 --> 00:22:37,119
making an example out of a mistake is a good thing.

399
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,359
Don't you think?

400
00:22:41,480 --> 00:22:42,160
Try this bun.

401
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:44,119
Our canteen's buns are pretty good,

402
00:22:45,839 --> 00:22:46,799
just a little heavy on the baking soda.

403
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:52,960
Commissar Tan.

404
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:57,880
I can't accept this "good thing" of yours.

405
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:02,559
You can go to Chief Guo.

406
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:09,640
Do we need to bother him over such a minor issue?

407
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:10,559
This is not a minor issue.

408
00:23:17,559 --> 00:23:17,960
Hello?

409
00:23:18,359 --> 00:23:19,960
Chief Liao, something happened to Naonao.

410
00:23:20,279 --> 00:23:20,759
Naonao?

411
00:23:24,599 --> 00:23:26,680
25 Rongda Street, Haoyunlai Convenience Store.

412
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:27,920
Hurry up.

413
00:23:28,640 --> 00:23:29,200
By the Special Police Unit.

414
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:29,680
Naonao!

415
00:23:29,960 --> 00:23:31,160
Yes, yes, the convenience store opposite.

416
00:23:32,599 --> 00:23:33,079
What happened?

417
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:33,920
A tire blew out on the road.

418
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:35,039
Naonao got scared and had a heart attack.

419
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:35,920
Did you call an ambulance?

420
00:23:36,119 --> 00:23:37,519
I did. It'll take 30 minutes to arrive.

421
00:23:37,759 --> 00:23:38,880
They won't make it in morning rush hour.

422
00:23:38,920 --> 00:23:39,599
Take my car, Chief Liao.

423
00:23:39,640 --> 00:23:40,680
Wouldn't your car get stuck in traffic too?

424
00:23:40,799 --> 00:23:41,480
Take the patrol car. Activate the siren.

425
00:23:41,480 --> 00:23:41,799
Yes, sir.

426
00:23:43,079 --> 00:23:44,519
Don't scare me, Naonao.

427
00:23:45,319 --> 00:23:46,680
Don't scare me, Naonao.

428
00:24:24,279 --> 00:24:25,000
Naonao!

429
00:24:25,359 --> 00:24:26,160
Keep him lying flat.

430
00:24:26,279 --> 00:24:27,440
Spread his feet shoulder-width apart.

431
00:24:27,720 --> 00:24:28,440
To reduce the strain on his heart.

432
00:24:28,440 --> 00:24:29,319
Lie flat, feet apart.

433
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:29,640
Hurry!

434
00:24:30,119 --> 00:24:30,599
Is he still conscious?

435
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:32,599
Check if he's lost consciousness.

436
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:34,680
Naonao, can you hear Mommy?

437
00:24:34,839 --> 00:24:35,559
Can you hear me?

438
00:24:35,599 --> 00:24:36,880
Naonao, can you hear me? Naonao!

439
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:38,119
Doctor, he's unconscious.

440
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:39,839
Start Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation immediately.

441
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:46,759
Naonao, Mommy's right here.

442
00:24:46,799 --> 00:24:48,000
Wake up, Naonao!

443
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:49,799
Doctor, he's not responding. What do I do?

444
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:51,880
Keep doing compressions. Keep the rhythm steady.

445
00:24:52,279 --> 00:24:53,960
About 100 to 120 times a minute.

446
00:24:54,319 --> 00:24:55,440
After every 30 compressions,

447
00:24:55,440 --> 00:24:56,359
give two rescue breaths.

448
00:24:56,599 --> 00:24:57,880
Continue until the patient wakes up.

449
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:03,680
Naonao!

450
00:25:04,839 --> 00:25:05,480
Naonao!

451
00:25:06,359 --> 00:25:07,279
Lü Xiao, hurry up!

452
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:07,920
Almost there!

453
00:25:08,559 --> 00:25:10,519
Naonao, are you okay?

454
00:25:12,839 --> 00:25:13,680
Naonao!

455
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:34,720
Naonao

456
00:25:35,480 --> 00:25:37,440
Where are we, Mom?

457
00:25:37,839 --> 00:25:38,359
You're awake.

458
00:25:40,519 --> 00:25:41,519
We're in the hospital.

459
00:25:42,839 --> 00:25:44,240
You got quite a scare.

460
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:46,200
Uncle Liao and his team brought you here.

461
00:25:49,039 --> 00:25:50,240
Where is Uncle Liao?

462
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:53,039
Uncle Liao.

463
00:25:54,119 --> 00:25:54,720
Looking for me?

464
00:25:54,759 --> 00:25:55,119
Chief Liao.

465
00:25:56,640 --> 00:25:57,240
You're awake.

466
00:25:58,079 --> 00:25:59,079
The doctor says you're fine.

467
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:00,920
You can go home tomorrow night.

468
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:07,079
I'll take off now.

469
00:26:07,720 --> 00:26:08,880
I'll call Bai Jiani over.

470
00:26:09,119 --> 00:26:09,960
You two can look after him.

471
00:26:10,160 --> 00:26:10,480
Okay.

472
00:26:10,839 --> 00:26:12,039
Thank you so much for today.

473
00:26:12,400 --> 00:26:13,440
If it weren't for your help,

474
00:26:13,480 --> 00:26:14,920
I really don't know what would've happened.

475
00:26:15,200 --> 00:26:15,720
It's nothing.

476
00:26:16,279 --> 00:26:17,039
It's what police do.

477
00:26:18,599 --> 00:26:20,480
We'd do the same for any other child.

478
00:26:24,759 --> 00:26:26,359
I want to apologize for what happened to Naonao.

479
00:26:27,599 --> 00:26:28,920
But I reached out to the city bureau leaders

480
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:30,480
and applied for psychological counseling.

481
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:32,119
It should be approved soon.

482
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:34,079
You can't be blamed for this.

483
00:26:34,640 --> 00:26:36,680
You've already helped us so much.

484
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:37,720
Don't mention it.

485
00:26:39,319 --> 00:26:40,039
I'll get going now.

486
00:26:41,519 --> 00:26:41,880
Bye.

487
00:26:42,319 --> 00:26:42,799
Bye.

488
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:46,279
Thank you, Chief Liao.

489
00:26:52,519 --> 00:26:53,240
You're doing much better.

490
00:26:54,839 --> 00:26:55,759
It doesn't hurt anymore, right?

491
00:26:58,960 --> 00:27:00,319
Does it have to be specially approved?

492
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:07,839
I understand, Ms. Chen.

493
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:10,799
Thank you.

494
00:27:14,440 --> 00:27:14,799
Liao.

495
00:27:17,160 --> 00:27:18,839
You, go to room 519 on the fifth floor.

496
00:27:20,640 --> 00:27:21,880
Room 519. Lü Xiao is waiting for you.

497
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:22,799
Yes, sir.

498
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:24,480
How's the kid?

499
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:28,440
What's wrong?

500
00:27:31,039 --> 00:27:32,039
It didn't get approved.

501
00:27:32,799 --> 00:27:33,640
What didn't get approved?

502
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:36,599
The application I submitted for Naonao's

503
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:38,279
psychological counseling.

504
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:40,480
Ms. Chen said

505
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:42,680
it's only for internal police consultations.

506
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:44,039
It's not for the public.

507
00:27:44,319 --> 00:27:45,480
Unless there's special approval from leadership.

508
00:27:47,039 --> 00:27:48,440
Special approval from leadership?

509
00:27:50,880 --> 00:27:52,079
Then let Commissar Tan handle it.

510
00:27:52,079 --> 00:27:53,519
Can't I just go directly to Chief Guo?

511
00:27:55,680 --> 00:27:57,319
At least he's better at communicating than you.

512
00:27:58,400 --> 00:27:59,079
Think about it.

513
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:03,319
Let Commissar Tan try first.

514
00:28:03,839 --> 00:28:04,279
Alright, let's go.

515
00:28:04,279 --> 00:28:04,559
Yes.

516
00:28:04,759 --> 00:28:05,000
Let's go.

517
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:20,440
They left early this morning with the siren blaring.

518
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:23,480
Is there some kind of emergency?

519
00:28:24,759 --> 00:28:25,519
They went to save someone.

520
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:28,079
At the convenience store by the gate.

521
00:28:28,559 --> 00:28:29,160
That kid,

522
00:28:29,960 --> 00:28:30,359
Naonao.

523
00:28:30,839 --> 00:28:31,640
Had a sudden heart attack.

524
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:35,160
Good thing Chief Liao reacted in time.

525
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:36,680
He quickly drove the kid to the hospital.

526
00:28:37,720 --> 00:28:38,680
How is the kid?

527
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:39,880
He's fine for now,

528
00:28:41,559 --> 00:28:44,079
but the main thing is he needs follow-up treatment.

529
00:28:44,359 --> 00:28:45,200
Psychological counseling.

530
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:47,680
The situation was extremely critical.

531
00:28:48,119 --> 00:28:48,920
If they were a little later,

532
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:50,279
the kid might not have made it this time.

533
00:28:52,440 --> 00:28:53,799
Helping civilians is what we do,

534
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:57,799
but there are regulations for using police vehicles.

535
00:28:58,160 --> 00:28:59,079
I'm the one who dispatched the car.

536
00:28:59,960 --> 00:29:01,160
Just process it according to the rules.

537
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:06,359
Commissar,

538
00:29:07,039 --> 00:29:08,599
there's something you might not know.

539
00:29:09,359 --> 00:29:11,160
When we fired our guns to save people,

540
00:29:11,720 --> 00:29:12,359
it caused Naonao to

541
00:29:12,880 --> 00:29:14,640
suffer from gunshot-induced stress disorder.

542
00:29:15,160 --> 00:29:17,119
His attack this time is related to that.

543
00:29:22,160 --> 00:29:24,720
Then submit a late application, and I'll approve it.

544
00:29:25,240 --> 00:29:27,240
Rules are rigid, but we can be flexible.

545
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:28,160
Like I always say,

546
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:30,559
as leaders, we need to be compassionate.

547
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:35,640
Chief Liao always says

548
00:29:36,759 --> 00:29:38,960
that you're definitely a compassionate leader.

549
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:42,240
You wouldn't just stand by when civilians are in trouble.

550
00:29:45,039 --> 00:29:45,839
There's one more thing.

551
00:29:46,039 --> 00:29:47,119
About Naonao's

552
00:29:47,119 --> 00:29:49,279
follow-up psychological treatment.

553
00:29:49,680 --> 00:29:51,359
I know there's someone in our system,

554
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:53,920
an expert in this field

555
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,200
who specializes in psychological counseling.

556
00:29:55,759 --> 00:29:56,920
Named Chen Meihua. Are you familiar with her?

557
00:29:58,119 --> 00:29:58,720
I know her.

558
00:29:59,720 --> 00:30:02,359
Criminal investigation background, specializes in psychology.

559
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,359
Outstanding results.

560
00:30:03,759 --> 00:30:04,960
With special approval from bureau leaders,

561
00:30:04,960 --> 00:30:07,559
she established a psychological counseling room.

562
00:30:08,079 --> 00:30:11,160
She's solved psychological issues for many.

563
00:30:12,039 --> 00:30:13,119
We went to see her,

564
00:30:14,319 --> 00:30:15,440
but she said

565
00:30:16,839 --> 00:30:17,720
it might be a bit difficult.

566
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:20,000
Because she only treats our internal officers.

567
00:30:21,039 --> 00:30:21,640
Not the general public.

568
00:30:23,200 --> 00:30:24,519
So we were thinking,

569
00:30:24,519 --> 00:30:27,119
we might need special approval from the leadership.

570
00:30:28,119 --> 00:30:28,799
I was thinking,

571
00:30:29,279 --> 00:30:29,759
Commissar Tan,

572
00:30:30,599 --> 00:30:32,000
you've been working with Chief Guo

573
00:30:32,599 --> 00:30:33,400
for so long,

574
00:30:34,279 --> 00:30:35,519
maybe you could talk to him

575
00:30:36,200 --> 00:30:37,599
and get a special approval? What do you say?

576
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:53,920
All right.

577
00:30:55,079 --> 00:30:56,119
Thank you then, Commissar Tan.

578
00:30:57,079 --> 00:30:58,400
I happen to be going to the Municipal Bureau tomorrow

579
00:30:58,400 --> 00:31:00,160
to report the disciplinary decision regarding Lü Xiao.

580
00:31:02,359 --> 00:31:03,559
Wait, Commissar.

581
00:31:04,720 --> 00:31:06,039
Regarding Lü Xiao's case,

582
00:31:06,480 --> 00:31:07,559
I'd like to say a few more words.

583
00:31:10,599 --> 00:31:11,640
Lü Xiao definitely deserves to be punished,

584
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:13,079
but I think,

585
00:31:13,279 --> 00:31:14,839
since he earned merit by saving a life this time,

586
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:16,960
could we perhaps go easy on him?

587
00:31:18,559 --> 00:31:20,839
Merit is merit, and fault is fault. They're two different things.

588
00:31:21,079 --> 00:31:22,000
Right, Chief Liao?

589
00:31:22,480 --> 00:31:23,119
Yes.

590
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:27,400
As for Lü Xiao, I've made my decision.

591
00:31:28,440 --> 00:31:29,319
And I've said it before.

592
00:31:30,240 --> 00:31:31,519
I won't accept a department-wide public reprimand.

593
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:37,480
Commissar Tan!

594
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:39,559
I wouldn't dare

595
00:31:41,079 --> 00:31:41,599
beg you

596
00:31:42,400 --> 00:31:43,359
to let Lü Xiao's merits cancel out his faults.

597
00:31:44,119 --> 00:31:46,160
I only ask that we give him a lighter punishment.

598
00:31:46,160 --> 00:31:47,400
Not letting people finish their sentences...

599
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:49,319
What kind of bad habit is that?

600
00:31:53,039 --> 00:31:53,720
I've decided.

601
00:31:53,839 --> 00:31:54,920
This matter with Lü Xiao

602
00:31:55,039 --> 00:31:56,119
won't be reported to our superiors.

603
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:57,559
Really?

604
00:31:59,319 --> 00:32:00,160
I'm the Commissar.

605
00:32:01,359 --> 00:32:01,920
I don't speak nonsense.

606
00:32:03,440 --> 00:32:04,039
Hey, you.

607
00:32:18,119 --> 00:32:19,000
Hello. I'd like to pay a bill.

608
00:32:19,119 --> 00:32:19,599
Hello.

609
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:24,839
The bill for Bed 1 has already been paid.

610
00:32:25,799 --> 00:32:26,559
Already paid?

611
00:32:26,759 --> 00:32:27,039
Yes.

612
00:32:28,079 --> 00:32:28,720
Who paid it?

613
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:30,880
I'm not really sure about that.

614
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:34,519
Okay. Thanks.

615
00:32:51,359 --> 00:32:52,319
Don't take too much.

616
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:13,839
A Yuan, don't get the wrong idea.

617
00:33:14,559 --> 00:33:15,799
I really wasn't following you.

618
00:33:17,000 --> 00:33:17,799
You saw it yourself.

619
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:20,799
These kids from the orphanage...

620
00:33:21,799 --> 00:33:22,920
I brought them to the hospital

621
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:24,039
for a physical checkup.

622
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:26,160
If they find any issues, I figured

623
00:33:28,519 --> 00:33:30,119
I could cover their medical bills.

624
00:33:30,559 --> 00:33:31,240
Isn't that a good thing?

625
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:33,599
The evil you've done

626
00:33:33,799 --> 00:33:36,400
can't be undone by any amount of good deeds.

627
00:33:42,599 --> 00:33:43,839
I'm actually just like you.

628
00:33:44,920 --> 00:33:46,960
I also want Naonao to be healthy.

629
00:33:46,960 --> 00:33:47,519
I know.

630
00:33:48,119 --> 00:33:50,039
Growing up, Naonao never really interacted

631
00:33:50,039 --> 00:33:51,160
with kids his own age.

632
00:33:51,160 --> 00:33:52,880
It's inevitable that he's a bit withdrawn.

633
00:33:53,519 --> 00:33:54,839
But coming here this time,

634
00:33:57,599 --> 00:33:58,839
I had a slightly selfish motive.

635
00:34:02,319 --> 00:34:03,319
I was thinking

636
00:34:04,240 --> 00:34:05,079
about going to the orphanage

637
00:34:05,599 --> 00:34:07,559
and picking out two cheerful, lively kids

638
00:34:08,239 --> 00:34:09,320
to adopt myself.

639
00:34:10,639 --> 00:34:11,800
So they can keep Naonao company in the future.

640
00:34:14,199 --> 00:34:17,000
Enough. Don't just stand there. Go see Naonao.

641
00:34:17,599 --> 00:34:17,920
Let's go.

642
00:34:20,639 --> 00:34:21,440
Look at this chocolate.

643
00:34:22,039 --> 00:34:24,599
In a second, guess which hand doesn't have it,

644
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:26,000
and I'll give it to you.

645
00:34:26,599 --> 00:34:27,119
Sound good?

646
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:33,760
Go on, guess.

647
00:34:34,400 --> 00:34:35,480
It's in both hands.

648
00:34:38,199 --> 00:34:40,440
I told you to learn a harder trick.

649
00:34:40,760 --> 00:34:41,440
You show him one.

650
00:34:42,239 --> 00:34:42,639
Naonao.

651
00:34:46,039 --> 00:34:47,039
Daddy's here to see you.

652
00:34:49,239 --> 00:34:49,920
Feeling any better?

653
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:51,719
Does anything hurt?

654
00:34:54,800 --> 00:34:55,480
Daddy's asking you a question.

655
00:34:59,519 --> 00:35:00,440
Everything hurts.

656
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:06,519
How about this?

657
00:35:07,800 --> 00:35:10,480
Mommy and Daddy will take you home tonight.

658
00:35:11,199 --> 00:35:12,039
Back to our own house, okay?

659
00:35:12,440 --> 00:35:13,400
He just calmed down.

660
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:14,239
Let him rest for a bit.

661
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:15,320
Okay.

662
00:35:17,679 --> 00:35:19,519
You guys talk. We'll wait by the door.

663
00:35:19,719 --> 00:35:20,480
You don't have to leave.

664
00:35:20,480 --> 00:35:21,519
Just find a place to sit for a bit.

665
00:35:22,400 --> 00:35:23,360
Special Police comrades, right?

666
00:35:24,039 --> 00:35:25,000
We were really lucky to have you today.

667
00:35:25,320 --> 00:35:25,840
Thank you so much.

668
00:35:26,119 --> 00:35:27,320
Don't mention it. It's our duty.

669
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:29,320
By the way,

670
00:35:29,719 --> 00:35:31,039
a couple of days ago on the bar street,

671
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:32,639
I saw some special police on patrol.

672
00:35:33,039 --> 00:35:34,840
Your uniforms are exactly the same as theirs.

673
00:35:35,039 --> 00:35:36,119
You must be from the same unit.

674
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:37,000
Definitely.

675
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:39,000
We're the only Special Police Unit in all of Red Leaf.

676
00:35:41,360 --> 00:35:42,800
With you guys here in Red Leaf,

677
00:35:43,440 --> 00:35:45,119
we citizens feel much more at ease.

678
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:47,800
A Yuan.

679
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:49,199
Tell you what,

680
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:52,199
let's take these two comrades out

681
00:35:52,559 --> 00:35:53,840
for a meal later, okay?

682
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:56,519
No need. We just ate.

683
00:35:56,840 --> 00:35:58,440
We'll just wait for you by the door.

684
00:35:58,480 --> 00:35:59,039
By the door.

685
00:35:59,320 --> 00:35:59,760
Wait by the door.

686
00:36:00,039 --> 00:36:00,440
Okay.

687
00:36:01,559 --> 00:36:02,800
Thank you. Thanks a lot.

688
00:36:18,400 --> 00:36:19,119
Naonao is so good.

689
00:36:21,440 --> 00:36:21,960
A Yuan.

690
00:36:23,159 --> 00:36:24,480
You still need to eat.

691
00:36:25,360 --> 00:36:27,079
What happens to Naonao if you starve?

692
00:36:28,719 --> 00:36:29,119
I'll tell you what.

693
00:36:30,159 --> 00:36:31,800
Let's go get something to eat in a bit.

694
00:36:32,719 --> 00:36:33,920
There's something I need to tell you.

695
00:36:37,599 --> 00:36:38,000
Naonao.

696
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:41,119
I know I made a mistake,

697
00:36:42,039 --> 00:36:44,360
but Old Tan is using me to assert his authority and make me yield.

698
00:36:44,639 --> 00:36:45,760
It's as clear as day.

699
00:36:46,519 --> 00:36:48,519
He's combining this with the puking figure incident

700
00:36:48,800 --> 00:36:49,480
to really stick it to me.

701
00:36:51,039 --> 00:36:52,400
I'm not putting up with this crap.

702
00:36:54,519 --> 00:36:56,440
Fine. As long as you're happy.

703
00:36:59,039 --> 00:37:00,920
Chief Liao's pride isn't worth much anyway.

704
00:37:03,639 --> 00:37:04,199
What do you mean?

705
00:37:05,480 --> 00:37:05,719
Right.

706
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:07,400
You didn't see it this morning.

707
00:37:08,039 --> 00:37:10,119
How Chief Liao was smiling apologetically at Commissar Tan

708
00:37:10,119 --> 00:37:10,920
pleading on your behalf.

709
00:37:17,559 --> 00:37:18,519
Decided where you're going?

710
00:37:20,639 --> 00:37:21,599
Anywhere is fine.

711
00:37:22,519 --> 00:37:23,440
I asked around.

712
00:37:24,039 --> 00:37:25,840
The K-9 unit is short-staffed. It's perfect.

713
00:37:31,119 --> 00:37:31,599
Young Master.

714
00:37:32,440 --> 00:37:33,639
You don't have to go to the K-9 unit.

715
00:37:36,039 --> 00:37:37,119
The disciplinary decision is out.

716
00:37:43,440 --> 00:37:47,000
Given Comrade Lü Xiao's meritorious service,

717
00:37:47,239 --> 00:37:49,400
the original request for a department-wide public reprimand

718
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:51,599
is changed to an internal reprimand.

719
00:37:54,440 --> 00:37:54,920
In addition,

720
00:37:55,639 --> 00:37:56,559
next Monday,

721
00:37:57,119 --> 00:38:00,360
Lü Xiao must make a deep self-criticism to the whole team

722
00:38:00,639 --> 00:38:01,360
as a warning.

723
00:38:05,360 --> 00:38:07,320
A self-criticism in front of the whole team?

724
00:38:08,920 --> 00:38:10,000
How embarrassing.

725
00:38:11,199 --> 00:38:12,360
Be grateful.

726
00:38:12,440 --> 00:38:14,320
Even this result is because Chief Liao swallowed his pride

727
00:38:14,440 --> 00:38:15,239
and begged for you.

728
00:38:24,480 --> 00:38:25,639
I think something's off about this.

729
00:38:27,440 --> 00:38:28,480
What's off?

730
00:38:29,800 --> 00:38:31,039
Commissar Tan's decision

731
00:38:31,639 --> 00:38:32,639
was way too sudden.

732
00:38:34,679 --> 00:38:35,840
As long as the result is good, that's all that matters.

733
00:38:36,880 --> 00:38:38,400
I think from the very beginning,

734
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:41,480
he never really intended to request a department-wide public reprimand.

735
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:43,199
He was just waiting for us to beg him.

736
00:38:43,519 --> 00:38:44,239
Waiting for us to yield.

737
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:45,440
Don't you think?

738
00:38:46,440 --> 00:38:48,920
Don't think you can survive just by acting tough.

739
00:38:49,599 --> 00:38:52,199
You have to yield when you need to.

740
00:38:54,639 --> 00:38:57,559
We still owe him a favor for this.

741
00:38:58,679 --> 00:38:59,519
That's why I say,

742
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:02,599
Commissar Tan is full of schemes.

743
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:11,719
Do you remember this place?

744
00:39:12,840 --> 00:39:14,599
We met here for the very first time.

745
00:39:17,039 --> 00:39:19,800
Back then, it was only half this size

746
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:21,519
and had no decor at all.

747
00:39:24,679 --> 00:39:26,280
You were newly pregnant back then.

748
00:39:27,599 --> 00:39:29,639
Every time you came to get your free folic acid,

749
00:39:30,599 --> 00:39:32,280
you'd always come here for a bowl of wontons.

750
00:39:37,119 --> 00:39:38,440
And you, a big boss,

751
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:41,119
put on a whole act

752
00:39:41,559 --> 00:39:42,760
and ate them with me for a whole month.

753
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:45,159
You really went to great lengths.

754
00:39:49,559 --> 00:39:50,960
I wouldn't say I went to great lengths.

755
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:52,840
I was just curious.

756
00:39:54,519 --> 00:39:57,440
How such a delicate girl

757
00:39:58,079 --> 00:39:58,840
could sit here,

758
00:39:59,760 --> 00:40:00,800
crying her eyes out

759
00:40:01,639 --> 00:40:03,119
while stuffing her face with wontons.

760
00:40:04,679 --> 00:40:05,880
I was thinking at the time,

761
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:09,079
what exactly had she gone through?

762
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:15,320
Thank you.

763
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:24,159
Your food is all here.

764
00:40:24,280 --> 00:40:24,719
Thanks.

765
00:40:34,519 --> 00:40:35,559
You don't eat cilantro,

766
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:38,920
one scoop of chili oil,

767
00:40:42,840 --> 00:40:43,760
and one scoop of vinegar.

768
00:40:53,239 --> 00:40:53,800
Right?

769
00:40:56,519 --> 00:40:57,440
All your habits,

770
00:40:58,239 --> 00:40:58,920
I remember them all.

771
00:41:14,639 --> 00:41:16,480
Actually, I don't even like wontons.

772
00:41:18,320 --> 00:41:19,719
I didn't have any money back then.

773
00:41:20,760 --> 00:41:21,760
I couldn't afford anything else,

774
00:41:24,119 --> 00:41:25,519
and I worried about Naonao's nutrition.

775
00:41:27,039 --> 00:41:28,039
Every time,

776
00:41:29,199 --> 00:41:30,960
I forced them down my throat.

777
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:34,360
I'd eat until I felt like throwing up.

778
00:41:39,719 --> 00:41:40,239
I see.

779
00:41:43,039 --> 00:41:44,159
It seems over the years,

780
00:41:45,039 --> 00:41:46,599
I haven't cared for you enough.

781
00:41:51,199 --> 00:41:52,440
I don't need your concern.

782
00:41:53,840 --> 00:41:56,119
We just have a partnership.

783
00:41:57,639 --> 00:41:59,280
Those terrible things...

784
00:42:01,440 --> 00:42:02,320
I won't get involved in them anymore.

785
00:42:07,719 --> 00:42:08,920
Once some things begin,

786
00:42:08,920 --> 00:42:10,079
they're destined never to stop.

787
00:42:11,199 --> 00:42:12,159
It's not up to me,

788
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:13,840
and it's not up to you either.

789
00:42:15,519 --> 00:42:17,039
To get through this safely,

790
00:42:18,760 --> 00:42:19,360
I need you.

791
00:42:20,639 --> 00:42:21,480
And you need me too.

792
00:42:21,480 --> 00:42:22,480
It's not me you need.

793
00:42:24,719 --> 00:42:26,400
I've paid back what I owed.

794
00:42:27,199 --> 00:42:28,480
And I've given what I had to.

795
00:42:33,800 --> 00:42:34,280
I admit it.

796
00:42:39,760 --> 00:42:40,320
A Yuan,

797
00:42:42,840 --> 00:42:44,480
for the sake of these past years,

798
00:42:45,880 --> 00:42:47,079
could you help me one more time?

799
00:42:50,239 --> 00:42:51,159
What if I refuse?

800
00:42:51,159 --> 00:42:52,079
Don't rush to decide.

801
00:42:54,199 --> 00:42:54,920
I'll give you time.

802
00:43:12,239 --> 00:43:14,440
Our Special Police Unit's training ground...

803
00:43:14,559 --> 00:43:16,119
When will it be sorted out?

804
00:43:16,239 --> 00:43:16,920
Looks like

805
00:43:17,159 --> 00:43:18,360
you're starting to fit in.

806
00:43:18,599 --> 00:43:20,840
I'm mainly worried about affecting your family's harmony.

807
00:43:21,079 --> 00:43:22,440
I didn't realize my moving out

808
00:43:22,440 --> 00:43:24,519
would traumatize you this much.

809
00:43:24,800 --> 00:43:26,119
I'll move back in tomorrow.

810
00:43:26,480 --> 00:43:27,639
Where is Naonao's dad?

811
00:43:27,719 --> 00:43:29,119
I've never seen his dad visit him.

812
00:43:29,280 --> 00:43:31,719
Not everyone deserves to be a father.

813
00:43:32,880 --> 00:43:33,400
Brother Feng.

814
00:43:33,880 --> 00:43:35,679
Your wife and kid went back to the convenience store.
